{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N++ is a fast-paced, momentum-based platformer about darting around obstacles, narrowly evading enemies and collecting gold in a beautiful minimalist landscape. It\u2019s the first N game on PC since 2004 and we\u2019ve spent those 12 years perfecting the platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N++ is all about using your momentum to complete levels and get high scores, but in this sci-fi world, there\u2019s a slew of inadvertently homicidal enemy robots trying to prevent you from completing your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the hand-crafted (NOT procedurally generated) levels, you\u2019ll experience platforming at its most intense. Using only your fluid movement, you need to \u2018solve\u2019 each level and get to the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the lengthy and challenging single player campaign, we\u2019ve packed a ton of features into this one last entry in the N series including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4,690 hand-made levels  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom Levels, Level Editor &amp; Global Level Sharing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leaderboards and replays for every level (even the ones you make)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local Co-op Mode (up to 4 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local Competitive Mode (up to 4 Players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hardcore Mode, an intense single-player challenge which only the best ninjas will survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Intense, hidden Secret challenges to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-63 tracks by top electronic artists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-125 different color palettes let you customize the game\u2019s look and keep it fresh every time you play </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a little, or a lot -- there's no skill ceiling, so you can always get better and better. N++ is a game that has enough bite-sized gameplay to last you a lifetime.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You Suck But That's Okay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/00a157e3fb79c13ce9b6aa051a9e5aebd7cf6d3a.jpg"},{"name":"Practice Makes Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/048807e61d05769b9bb1ca4ea0aa59c29e7515e4.jpg"},{"name":"More Practice Makes More Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/6c75b6621043231675a97fbace60485ea895eddf.jpg"},{"name":"Perfection is Overrated Anyway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/d413558fef95cf0ed6d7c9c52bebe4664cfa0102.jpg"},{"name":"Achieve Enlightenment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/9fc43104efe3017d5c10bc33e4878a0ee6878de7.jpg"},{"name":"Perseverance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/fa81e2d88662df07382dfe4d3e7a749ba77263c3.jpg"},{"name":"Death from All of the Above","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/19c1ecaeb084006de8b383dd6939d8c48d1e6c2b.jpg"},{"name":"Using your Head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/bac7c7eb44b4cc622b575e3c05ed89ead261849d.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/c898f6e91575bdfae3c9ac203cbf8a5bf901e2f8.jpg"},{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230270/cd02fb14f651d43a7e6e2e1065be0dee1a069263.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/230270?t=1762366272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762366272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/20edcf0a5611b2bbfcced30bd54840ad2c36e420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762366272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/20edcf0a5611b2bbfcced30bd54840ad2c36e420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762366272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N++ is a fast-paced, momentum-based platformer about darting around obstacles, narrowly evading enemies and collecting gold in a beautiful minimalist landscape. It\u2019s the first N game on PC since 2004 and we\u2019ve spent those 12 years perfecting the platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N++ is all about using your momentum to complete levels and get high scores, but in this sci-fi world, there\u2019s a slew of inadvertently homicidal enemy robots trying to prevent you from completing your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the hand-crafted (NOT procedurally generated) levels, you\u2019ll experience platforming at its most intense. Using only your fluid movement, you need to \u2018solve\u2019 each level and get to the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the lengthy and challenging single player campaign, we\u2019ve packed a ton of features into this one last entry in the N series including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4,690 hand-made levels  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom Levels, Level Editor &amp; Global Level Sharing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leaderboards and replays for every level (even the ones you make)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local Co-op Mode (up to 4 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local Competitive Mode (up to 4 Players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hardcore Mode, an intense single-player challenge which only the best ninjas will survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Intense, hidden Secret challenges to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-63 tracks by top electronic artists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-125 different color palettes let you customize the game\u2019s look and keep it fresh every time you play </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a little, or a lot -- there's no skill ceiling, so you can always get better and better. N++ is a game that has enough bite-sized gameplay to last you a lifetime.</p>","developers":["Metanet Software Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/4ac1afbdcbfe0f72fc528ebedf28c0016924b6b0/header.jpg?t=1762366272","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Metanet Software Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> X<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> (to be updated shortly!)</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomme