nemy, whether it be rocket launcher or mine, is optimised to be challenging but not unfair\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 The Digital Fix<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_9a1b37fe4a4b192bfb9f42a83cf37ba24a3758a2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762366272","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_9a1b37fe4a4b192bfb9f42a83cf37ba24a3758a2.600x338.jpg?t=1762366272"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_262b6403f0e955f1f4a6c80c1914e0e997d06e9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762366272","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_262b6403f0e955f1f4a6c80c1914e0e997d06e9a.600x338.jpg?t=1762366272"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_717a25cb3bf6709000c9d1ad0e6c17e5d81d9181.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762366272","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_717a25cb3bf6709000c9d1ad0e6c17e5d81d9181.600x338.jpg?t=1762366272"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_a81b899ec6fb836e37089fea1f07e179d18ee6cf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762366272","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_a81b899ec6fb836e37089fea1f07e179d18ee6cf.600x338.jpg?t=1762366272"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_9914aac1667a85b72a07e6e0a63e249c4a571d67.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762366272","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_9914aac1667a85b72a07e6e0a63e249c4a571d67.600x338.jpg?t=1762366272"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230270/ss_e20d25f4d1b83220e06ed48a9c25ed83f03a0769.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762366272","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.ak